rtant;\">\n          Chamomile, Lemongrass, Orange, Jasmine tea-like\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q36MicNiclTfcCUkjP6ZaWC6TuSBFdG4b00oOkHd97wB6V2VlSqkrnIaCSyJ16FV2GkicZCPWzhfT7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 840px;width: 578px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 Fazenda Guariroba 棕榈树庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);transform-origin: 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TYSibVOfDRbicMRo8QHasfia2JzibF9IAJkZArPVRvl2Uy0c2oHicbFfzSKYiaySSKPXbYejibWDvTdxQDg/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"text-align: center;\"/>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          图片来自cafeimports 棕榈树位于Sul de Minas\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Guariroba位于南米纳斯的圣安东尼奥杜安帕鲁（翻译这个名字好痛苦呀）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2XLhKFemT9icTePokZPzpZazibWIWHLp8VRO7SohibdxSNxv84QRMUXSTQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          早在19世纪，创始人João Ferreira Carneiro就已经在Santo Antônio do Amparo肥沃的土地上生产咖啡，它就是今天的Fazenda Guariroba的前身，对改良咖啡的痴迷和渴望也代代相传下来。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2D1cVrcVnObJ9JZ2BTYL2eppBxAw6j21IFUtbefUmDWxSNHYian9NCWg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='font-size: 12px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          庄园第五代 - Homero Aguiar Paiva\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          霍梅罗Homero Aguiar Paiva，一位土木工程师和家族的第五代传人，在2009年从他的叔叔Fernando Paiva那里获得了历史悠久的百年庄园Fazenda Cachoeira的一部分，继续种植咖啡。在他的兄弟雷纳托·派瓦(Renato Paiva)的指导下，霍梅罗选择了较好的品种开始种植，并将这片土地命名为棕榈树庄园(Guariroba Farm)，以纪念他的外祖父母。从那时起，追求卓越和保存最纯净的传统成为该农场的口号，优越的风土条件和家族的丰富知识使Homero Paiva在专业咖啡生产方面取得了卓越的成就，其中就包括2016年巴西卓越杯竞赛的日晒组第一名。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          获得奖项\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          2016 巴西CoE #1（日晒组别）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Catuai-Mundo Novo-Topazio\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Catuai - 卡杜艾，在当地Tupi部族语言里是“very good”的意思，它是红色卡杜拉Caturra（代号IAC 476-11）与新世界Mundo Novo (代号374-19）于1949年在巴西圣保罗的科研中心IAC，人工将其杂交选育出来的，1972年开始在巴西商业种植推广。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Mundo Novo - 新世界，它是在巴西本土咖啡田里由波旁和苏门答腊种（从印尼引种来的）自然杂交而来的一个新品种，它有较高的树形，果实非常的紧密结实，树体强壮，非常的抗风，在巴西占据了近40%的种植，产量和杯品豆较高，相较其它品种会晚熟一些。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Topazio - 黄玉，巴西咖啡研究中心于上世纪60年代到70年代间，将新世界Mundo Novo品种与红卡杜艾结合再与卡杜艾回交的一个人工选育品种，它具有卡杜艾的矮树种特征，果实成熟后是黄色果实，成熟期和一致性都介于卡杜艾和新世界品种之间。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理过程\n         </span>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-style: solid;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);transform-origin: 0px 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);\"/>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          鲜果浮选（机械浮选）\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2zjcdUJmACx2Zgm4L9JsfUMMNZWPfIcQVnhAUykk2FkBlrKKhlvVprg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          晒干表面水份后装袋（本批次装袋是加入了咖啡果皮预发酵的发酵液浸渍）发酵3天，然后脱皮后再用一批新的同样的方式制作的咖啡发酵液加入Galaxy啤酒花一起浸渍发酵3天，期间每24小时搅拌一次。\n         </span>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TYQVOuBAwWw6PNkxee7TZ2HWyK3GRicqDPFHzGDDjLiahfFt9icIL21rslXWJWVOYpCcXzNMyVy3BLw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 545px;width: 578px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          然后发酵结束后再棚架上缓慢干燥25天左右，含水率达标10.5%左右时收储静置。\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TMPppAtBf3nsz9EF8EFCgU5icfIF5H7g5ZeZDEEQmibXYsTdLlNFxR2b9jWhwZ5WV7bBxkMxp2tdKQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
